-- NOT the L4 date library: a module of the author's own called `daydate.l4`,
-- beside the file that imports it, whose `YMD` adds a year. Before the export
-- asked which module is the library, `YMD 2024 1 2` was written as
-- date("2024-01-02") while `l4 run` answered 2 January 2025.
GIVEN year  IS A NUMBER
      month IS A NUMBER
      day   IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A DATE
`YMD` year month day MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY day month (year PLUS 1)
